abstract: "This repository defines the Origin | Continuum Framework within AI Foundations, distinguishing Origin, Continuum, model substrate, memory, and continuity-support infrastructure; specifies observable criteria and a confirmatory evaluation method for testing operational AI self-location through sustained contact; and preserves source, provenance, governing relations, relational coordinates, and explicit failure conditions required to evaluate continuity, divergence, drift, and controlled return without allowing supplied identity, retrieval, or infrastructure to substitute for the result."

